# NestJS Backend

## Module layout

```
apps/api/src/
  <domain>/
    <domain>.module.ts
    <domain>.controller.ts
    <domain>.service.ts
    dto/
  prisma/
    schema.prisma
```

## Patterns

- DTOs: `class-validator` decorators; share Zod schemas via `packages/shared`
- Database: inject `PrismaService`; no raw SQL unless justified
- Cache: `@nestjs/cache-manager` with Redis store
- Queues: `@nestjs/bullmq` with `@Processor()` for job handlers

```typescript
// ✅ BullMQ processor
@Processor('email')
export class EmailProcessor extends WorkerHost {
  async process(job: Job<SendEmailPayload>) { /* ... */ }
}
```

## API rules

- RESTful routes; consistent error shape `{ statusCode, message, error }`
- Validate all inputs via DTOs or Zod pipes
- Export shared types to `packages/shared` before frontend integration
- Log errors; never expose stack traces in production responses
